{
  "_comment": [
    "Paste the `hooks` block into ~/.claude/settings.json (all projects) or",
    ".claude/settings.json in one repository. If the file already has a `hooks`",
    "key, merge the event arrays rather than replacing them.",
    "",
    "Replace /path/to/gt-cloud with wherever you put the adapters. On Windows",
    "use forward slashes or escaped backslashes, and keep the quotes around the",
    "path so a directory with spaces still works:",
    "  python \"C:/Users/you/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\"",
    "",
    "Set GT_CLOUD_ORIGIN, GT_CLOUD_SESSION and GT_CLOUD_TOKEN in the environment",
    "you start `claude` from. Without them every hook below is a no-op that",
    "exits 0, so it is safe to leave configured when you are not reporting.",
    "",
    "PreToolUse and PostToolUse use the matcher \"*\" deliberately: a matcher",
    "listing tool names would silently miss PowerShell on Windows, MCP tools,",
    "and any tool added in a later version.",
    "",
    "The SessionEnd timeout is explicit because Claude Code gives SessionEnd",
    "hooks a 1.5 s budget by default, which is shorter than one network call."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python \"/path/to/gt-cloud/cloud/adapters/claude_code/gt_cloud_hook.py\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
